# ─── Design handoff source ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The zip and its unpacked copy are reference material, not part of the site.
# `extracted/` is fully derivable from the zip, so it never needs tracking.
#
# WARNING: these two hold the only copies of the original JPEG masters and of
# Dave-Euson-Resume.docx, the editable source the PDF is exported from.
# Ignoring them keeps the repo lean, but a clone cannot rebuild those assets.
# Keep a copy somewhere off this machine.
#
# They also must not ship. GitHub Pages serves whatever is in the published
# branch, and the résumé inside the bundle carries a phone number that is
# kept off the site.
extracted/
*.zip

# ─── Local settings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .claude/launch.json is shared config and stays tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ─── Editor and OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
